pes either, and why. Then I'll contrast negative vs. positive stereotypes, explaining the historical and social weight. I'll bring it back to the core issue: judging an individual based on a group label is unfair in all cases, but especially when the label is demeaning. I'll end by reiterating that they don't have to host her, but the reason shouldn't be rooted in a stereotype.
